# Character art: no baked-in text

Character portraits in `art/characters/` are picture-only. Captions live in the Codex, not in the pixels.

- No titles, watermarks, logos, dates, or “Original / The Last Lithoi” stamps on portraits (Seraphina, Rook, Malakar, Caelen, Varrick).
- If a character plate has overlay type, regenerate the likeness. Do not paint over letters.
- Key-art poster (`key-art-cast.png`) may keep a title; every other character file stays letterless.
- World / Shift plates are a separate call — do not strip those unless asked.
